It is shared for evaluation review only — not as open-source software under
a standard OSI license.

The Software must remain in its original repository
(https://github.com/ahmshili/sqltalk). It may not be forked, mirrored, or
re-published elsewhere (see "Not permitted" below). Submitting improvements
back to the original repository — as a pull request or a bug report — is
welcome and permitted.

