Upstream attribution

SQLTalk is a from-scratch architectural refactor inspired by the publicly
available open-source project `trinhvanminh/SQL_Agent`. No code, assets, or
license text from that repository is redistributed here; only the general
concept (a LangChain-based natural-language-to-SQL Streamlit assistant) is
shared. No LICENSE file was found in the upstream repository at the time of
this writing. If you are the author of that project and believe this notice
is insufficient, please reach out via the contact links above.
